# DroneAltPriorities: the texts of its OMS tab, in English. Godot shows English for any language without its own file
# (its fallback locale), so another language only needs a copy of this file with its Language and msgstr lines
# translated, loaded in ModMain.gd.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: en\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_TAB"
msgstr "DAP"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_ENABLED"
msgstr "Tug and haul drones pick the most valuable chunks first"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_HINT"
msgstr ""
"DroneAltPriorities mod: while this is on, your MPI Tug drones and MLF Haul Drones work first on the chunks your "
"geologist found the most valuable ore in, and stay on a chunk until it is done or a much better one comes. Which "
"chunks they may take is still set in the Geologist tab. The sliders set how much each figure counts; at 0 % it "
"doesn't count."

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_VALUE"
msgstr "Ore value"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_VALUE_DESC"
msgstr "How much the price per kg of the best ore in a chunk counts, as your geologist found it. Chunks not yet identified come after."

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_MASS"
msgstr "Ore mass"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_MASS_DESC"
msgstr "How much the mass of ore in a chunk counts, as your geologist estimates it. With Ore value at the same level, the drones go for the chunks worth the most."

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_INTAKE"
msgstr "Intake"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_INTAKE_DESC"
msgstr "How much it counts that a chunk is close to where the haul drones gather chunks, ahead of the excavator. Higher brings in more chunks, lower more value. Tug drones ignore it."

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_RESET"
msgstr "Reset to defaults"

msgid "DRONEALTPRIORITIES_RESET_DESC"
msgstr "Puts the switch and every slider of this tab back to their default values."
